{
"#name"
:
{
"termux"
:
null
,
"en"
:
"Termux Utility"
,
"cn"
:
"Termux 实用功能"
}
,
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"The termux module integrates various utility functions that Termux users may need"
,
"cn"
:
"termux 模块集成了 Termux 用户可能需要的各种实用功能"
}
,
"pr|proot"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"用户态模拟 chroot 环境，让非 root 用户在 Termux 中运行 Linux 发行版或隔离的文件系统。"
,
"en"
:
"User-space implementation of `chroot`, enabling unprivileged users to run Linux distributions or isolated filesystems within Termux."
}
,
"$ref"
:
"x-advise://termux/data/pr.jso"
}
,
"pd|proot-distro"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"基于 proot 的发行版管理工具，支持一键安装和启动 Ubuntu、Debian 等 Linux 发行版。"
,
"en"
:
"A PRoot-based Linux distribution manager for Termux, allowing easy installation and launching of distros like Ubuntu and Debian."
}
,
"$ref"
:
"x-advise://termux/data/pd.jso"
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x termux pd ls"
,
"cn"
:
"查看支持的发行版"
,
"en"
:
"List supported distributions"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x termux pd install ubuntu"
,
"cn"
:
"安装 Ubuntu 发行版"
,
"en"
:
"Install the Ubuntu distribution"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x termux pd run ubuntu"
,
"cn"
:
"启动 Ubuntu 发行版"
,
"en"
:
"Launch the Ubuntu distribution"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x termux pd login ubuntu"
,
"cn"
:
"登录 Ubuntu 发行版"
,
"en"
:
"Login to the Ubuntu distribution"
}
]
}
,
"prun"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Run a command in the specified distribution, equivalent to proot-distro run command"
,
"cn"
:
"在指定的发行版中运行命令，等同于 proot-distro run 命令"
}
}
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x termux pd install ubuntu"
,
"cn"
:
"安装 Ubuntu 发行版"
,
"en"
:
"Install the Ubuntu distribution"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x termux prun ubuntu bash"
,
"cn"
:
"在 Ubuntu 发行版中运行 bash"
}
]
,
"#other"
:
{
"en"
:
{
"Please visit our homepage for more information:"
:
"https://x-cmd.com"
}
,
"cn"
:
{
"请访问我们的主页以获取更多信息："
:
"https://x-cmd.com"
}
}
}

